[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9301.03, "timestamp": "02:35:01", "text": "全くプレイできませんでした。 私は忙しかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9310.87, "timestamp": "02:35:10", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9314.23, "timestamp": "02:35:14", "text": "でも、今言っておかなければならないことが一つあります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9319.83, "timestamp": "02:35:19", "text": "。日本語の練習を続けなければ、上達しません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9322.63, "timestamp": "02:35:22", "text": "ええ、特に実際に抑揚をつけて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9324.95, "timestamp": "02:35:24", "text": "話すことですね。 話すには"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9327.349, "timestamp": "02:35:27", "text": "息継ぎが必要で、特に読書にはそれが顕著です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9337.03, "timestamp": "02:35:37", "text": "読書は大切だ。 だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9339.99, "timestamp": "02:35:39", "text": "私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9351.56, "timestamp": "02:35:51", "text": "。"}]